* ============================================================
* MCC_TIER3_SANDBOX_MUTATION_CANARIES_V1.DTS
*
* Purpose:
*   Controlled mutation canaries for DotTalk++ MCC data.
*
* Tier:
*   Tier-3 — sandbox mutation / controlled write testing.
*
* Scope:
*   - COPY TO sandbox/temp target
*   - Open copied table only
*   - APPEND / REPLACE / DELETE / RECALL / PACK-style behavior only on sandbox copy
*   - Table buffer / COMMIT behavior on sandbox copy
*   - CDX/LMDB index mutation behavior may be observed only if sandbox index files are used
*
* Safety contract:
*   - Do NOT run against canonical DBF/X32 or DBF/X64 tables directly.
*   - Canonical source may be read only.
*   - All mutation must occur under DBF/SANDBOX or TMP.
*   - No ZAP.
*   - No wildcard ERASE.
*   - No PACK against canonical data.
*
* Important:
*   - This script assumes DBF/SANDBOX exists.
*   - It creates/overwrites temporary sandbox copies with explicit names.
*   - Review output before promoting any result to Tier-1.
*
* Display contract:
*   - SMARTLIST / TUPLE / RECNO are preferred.
*   - LIST may be used only as an observation probe.
* ============================================================

SET ECHO OFF
COLOR DEFAULT
ECHO ===== MCC TIER-3 SANDBOX MUTATION CANARIES V1 START =====

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* PHASE 0 - CLEAN START
* ------------------------------------------------------------
ECHO ===== PHASE 0 CLEAN START =====
SCHEMAS CLOSE
REL CLEAR ALL
SET FILTER TO
VERSION
STATUS

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* PHASE 1 - CREATE SANDBOX COPY FROM CANONICAL V64 STUDENTS
* ------------------------------------------------------------
ECHO ===== PHASE 1 CREATE SANDBOX COPY =====
SETPATH DBF DBF/X64
SETPATH INDEXES INDEXES/X64

USE STUDENTS
COUNT
TOP
TUPLE *

ECHO [SANDBOX] Copying canonical STUDENTS to DBF/SANDBOX/T3_STUDENTS.
ECHO [NOTE] If COPY refuses overwrite, delete/rename sandbox copy manually.
COPY TO DBF/SANDBOX/T3_STUDENTS
CLOSE

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* PHASE 2 - OPEN SANDBOX COPY ONLY
* ------------------------------------------------------------
ECHO ===== PHASE 2 OPEN SANDBOX COPY ONLY =====
SETPATH DBF DBF/SANDBOX
SETPATH INDEXES INDEXES/SANDBOX

USE T3_STUDENTS
AREA
COUNT
TOP
RECNO
TUPLE *

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* PHASE 3 - REVERSIBLE FIELD REPLACE WITHOUT BUFFER
* ------------------------------------------------------------
ECHO ===== PHASE 3 REVERSIBLE REPLACE DIRECT =====
ECHO [OBSERVE] Direct REPLACE on sandbox copy only.

LOCATE LNAME = "TAYLOR"
RECNO
TUPLE *

ECHO [MUTATE] Change FNAME to Tier3Probe.
REPLACE FNAME WITH "Tier3Probe"
TUPLE *

ECHO [RESTORE] Change FNAME back to Quinn.
REPLACE FNAME WITH "Quinn"
TUPLE *

TOP
RECNO
TUPLE *

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* PHASE 4 - TABLE BUFFER / COMMIT ON SANDBOX COPY
* ------------------------------------------------------------
ECHO ===== PHASE 4 TABLE BUFFER COMMIT =====
LOCATE LNAME = "TAYLOR"
RECNO
TUPLE *

TABLE ON
ECHO [BUFFER] Replace GPA + 0.01 under table buffer.
REPLACE GPA WITH GPA + 0.01
TUPLE GPA
TABLE STALE

ECHO [COMMIT] Commit buffered GPA increment.
COMMIT
TUPLE GPA

ECHO [BUFFER] Restore GPA - 0.01 under table buffer.
REPLACE GPA WITH GPA - 0.01
TUPLE GPA
COMMIT
TUPLE GPA
TABLE OFF

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* PHASE 5 - APPEND / DELETE / RECALL ON SANDBOX COPY
* ------------------------------------------------------------
ECHO ===== PHASE 5 APPEND DELETE RECALL SANDBOX =====
COUNT
BOTTOM
RECNO
TUPLE *

ECHO [MUTATE] Append one sandbox-only probe record.
APPEND
REPLACE SID WITH 59999999
REPLACE LNAME WITH "TierThree"
REPLACE FNAME WITH "Probe"
REPLACE DOB WITH 20000101
REPLACE GENDER WITH "X"
REPLACE MAJOR WITH "CSCI"
REPLACE ENROLL_D WITH 20260430
REPLACE GPA WITH 3.33
REPLACE EMAIL WITH "tier3.probe@student.mcc.edu"

ECHO [VERIFY] Locate appended probe.
LOCATE LNAME = "TIERTHREE"
RECNO
TUPLE *
COUNT

ECHO [MUTATE] Delete appended probe.
DELETE
COUNT
COUNT DELETED
COUNT NOT DELETED
TUPLE *

ECHO [MUTATE] Recall appended probe.
RECALL
COUNT
COUNT DELETED
COUNT NOT DELETED
TUPLE *

ECHO [RESTORE] Delete appended probe again; leave sandbox copy visibly dirty by design.
DELETE
COUNT
COUNT DELETED
COUNT NOT DELETED

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* PHASE 6 - FILTER / AGGREGATE AFTER MUTATION
* ------------------------------------------------------------
ECHO ===== PHASE 6 FILTER AGGREGATE AFTER MUTATION =====
SET FILTER TO LNAME = "TIERTHREE"
COUNT
SMARTLIST 10
SET FILTER TO

SET FILTER TO FNAME = "AVA"
COUNT
SUM GPA
AVERAGE GPA
SET FILTER TO

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* PHASE 7 - OPTIONAL PACK OBSERVATION ON SANDBOX ONLY
* ------------------------------------------------------------
ECHO ===== PHASE 7 PACK OBSERVATION SANDBOX ONLY =====
ECHO [MANUAL] PACK is intentionally not run automatically here.
ECHO [MANUAL] To test PACK safely, run:
ECHO [MANUAL]   USE T3_STUDENTS
ECHO [MANUAL]   PACK
ECHO [MANUAL]   COUNT DELETED
ECHO [MANUAL]   COUNT NOT DELETED

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* PHASE 8 - CLEAN SHUTDOWN
* ------------------------------------------------------------
ECHO ===== PHASE 8 CLEAN SHUTDOWN =====
SET FILTER TO
TABLE OFF
REL CLEAR ALL
CLOSE
SCHEMAS CLOSE
STATUS

ECHO ===== MCC TIER-3 SANDBOX MUTATION CANARIES V1 END =====
QUIT
